## 2. Sign the heartbeat (`06-api-contract.md`)

`POST /heartbeat` currently has no signature, so a killed agent's silence can be faked with an unsigned `curl` call, and A4 never fires.

Change the heartbeat request to:
```json
{ "platform_id": "victim-bank-1", "timestamp": "...", "signature": "base64..." }
```
Signed payload = canonical encoding of `{platform_id, timestamp}` (profile_hash is removed — see item 10). Witness verifies the signature against the registered public key for that `platform_id` before accepting the heartbeat and resetting the silence timer. An unsigned or badly-signed heartbeat does not count as liveness — the silence alert still fires.

