## 8. Mock anchor needs a pull route, since Laptop C can't receive calls

Laptop C only makes outbound calls (poll design). Add:

### `GET /anchor/latest`
```json
{ "chain_head_hash": "base64...", "anchored_at": "...", "signature": "base64..." }
```
Laptop C polls this every few minutes and appends what it gets to its local anchor file. This keeps the "witness never calls out" rule intact — C is still the one initiating the call.

