"Signed over the fields listed" names no concrete field list anywhere. Make it explicit in `06-api-contract.md`:
- **Entry signature:** canonical encoding (via `shared/`) of every entry field *except* `signature` itself (i.e. `seq` through `hash`, in the order listed in Step 1 / the entry schema).
